  "description": "This stock is no stranger, and we haven't had a bad trade with it yet...(knock on wood)",
  "body_html": "<p>I’ll keep this short and sweet. We have already had two good trades with this company. They essentially have a army of debt slaves. And even if someone does not pay them back, they just sell the loan off to a 3rd party. We recently bought this company, and capitalized on a 21% pump from earnings. We quickly sold off…because you just don’t let a 21% pump run away from you after holding for just a day. </p><p>That said…I like this company for a much longer term stance. Today, it broke out yet again. There cash flow continues to grow steadily year after year, and their EPS crossed into the positive here in  2025</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBCb!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F49725b83-7f2b-4af5-84c1-0e8c7b622df1_1453x117.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBCb!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F49725b83-7f2b-4af5-84c1-0e8c7b622df1_1453x117.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBCb!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F49725b83-7f2b-4af5-84c1-0e8c7b622df1_1453x117.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBCb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F49725b83-7f2b-4af5-84c1-0e8c7b622df1_1453x117.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBCb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F49725b83-7f2b-4af5-84c1-0e8c7b622df1_1453x117.png\" width